## 💻 2. በኮምፒውተር ላይ ፋይሎቹን በ 1 ጠቅታ ዚፕ (ZIP) የማድረጊያ ትዕዛዞች

### በ Windows (PowerShell)፦
```powershell
Compress-Archive -Path index.html, sw.js, offline.html, manifest.json, vercel.json, server -DestinationPath dessie-mart-production.zip
```

### በ Mac / Linux (Terminal)፦
```bash
zip -r dessie-mart-production.zip index.html sw.js offline.html manifest.json vercel.json server/
```

